@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
title RetailFlow - logical refund state machine
[*] --> PENDING : finance creates instruction / attempt
PENDING --> UNKNOWN : mock timeout / uncertain result
PENDING --> SUCCEEDED : confirmed success
PENDING --> FAILED : definitive failure
UNKNOWN --> SUCCEEDED : matched provider confirmation
UNKNOWN --> FAILED : matched definitive failure
FAILED --> PENDING : guarded retry / new attempt / same instruction
SUCCEEDED --> [*]
note right of UNKNOWN
  Reconcile existing attempt.
  Never blindly resubmit.
end note
note right of FAILED
  Mock provider guarantees definitive failure.
  Real provider semantics remain unvalidated.
end note
note bottom of SUCCEEDED
  Completes the corresponding return.
  Terminal attempts never regress.
  Logical refund FAILED can create a new attempt;
  the failed attempt itself remains terminal.
end note
@enduml
